      "source": "WELL-DRESSED PIRATE: *ahem*... Yar.#...#...Not convincing, huh?#*sigh*...#To tell you the truth, I don't really want to be a pirate. I'd rather grow palms.#Unfortunately, there's no money in the palm business...",
